  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">NTGL 是一個基於 MrCrayfish 的槍械模組的強大函式庫，讓你能夠在遊戲中加入各種類型的動畫武器：槍械、近戰武器、手榴彈和投擲物。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以透過槍械包（gun packs）來新增新武器或編輯現有武器，更多資訊請參閱&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Jetug/NukaTeamGunLib/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NTGL Wiki</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnjb6EKaDVJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152291880218939412?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=orange&amp;link=https://discord.com/invite/njb6EKaDVJ\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fnukateam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/Boosty-Support_us-ff5f5f?logo=boosty&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新功能：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">槍械包系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雙持武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可自訂武器 HUD</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">切換彈藥類型</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">射擊模式選擇</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生物死亡效果</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生物實體可使用槍械</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">內建投射物類型：子彈、雷射、電擊、火焰、飛彈、手榴彈</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>依賴項</strong></h2><h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1081/393/64/64/638621132937140582.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/871/312/256/256/638288810018379517.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a></h3><h2><strong>相容於</strong></h2><h3><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/477/479/64/64/637772195243234104_animated.gif\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/623/755/64/64/638018179275684974_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yyzsbackpack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1311/976/64/64/638853154143594604.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/375/56/64/64/637549610342642859.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controllable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/871/319/64/64/638288811093619347.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/588/418/64/64/637958435315527412.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></strong></a></h3><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/subtle-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1001/518/64/64/638521081241619465.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h2><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>&nbsp;</h1>",
